      "text": "I bought it from Aimportar. I have own an S9 for a few years, unfortunately the screen cracked accidentally. To replace the screen would cost the same as buying a new one so I bought this one. It came totally drained, battery was 7%. I put it to charge and is taking forever to charge while my older one is faster with the same charger. To turn on the new one takes a while, like the initial screen take a long time to load, my old one is much faster in turning on. I am a creature of habit. I did not like that it took long to charge and especially I hated that it took so long to turn on, first the t-mobile logo, then a black screen, then an hourglass, then a few more seconds to wait, it is too long!",
